        <obo:IAO_0000115>a respiratory system AE which has an outcome of postnasal drip, which occurs when excessive mucus is produced by the nasal Mucosa. The excess mucus accumulates in the throat or back of the nose.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>SS, YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
