        <obo:OAE_0004334>10016558</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10037660</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:comment>Fever is a frequent medical sign that describes an increase in internal body temperature to levels above normal. Fever is characterized as a temporary elevation in the body&apos;s thermoregulatory set-point, usually by about 1-2 °F).</rdfs:comment>
