        <obo:IAO_0000115>a leukocyte cell number abnormal AE that has an outcome of reduction in the number of leukocytes, or of nucleated cells of the myeloid or lymphoid lineages, found in blood or other tissue</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;leukopenia&apos; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 417 VAERS reports (0.3%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>decreased leukocyte cell number AE</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>white blood cell count decreased AE</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10047942</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>leukocyte cell number decreased AE</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>CTCAE: E12232</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>MP: MP_0000221</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>NCIt: C26816</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


