        <obo:IAO_0000115>a skin adverse event that has an outcome of sweating</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;sweating&apos; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 2,301 VAERS reports (1.8%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>sweating AE</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>HPO: HP_0000975</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>SIDER: C0038990</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000402 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000402">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000374"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;abdominal pain&apos; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 2,254 VAERS reports (1.8%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH, SS</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdominal_pain</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10000081</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:comment>a pain AE that is observed in abdominal cavity</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>abdominal pain AE</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>HPO: HP_0002027</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>SIDER: C0000737</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000403 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000403">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000381"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>an abnormal blood pressure AE that has an outcome of sustained high blood pressure at a level that is likely to result in cardiovascular disease and/or other pathological states</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH, SS, MW</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>blood pressure increased</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21722707</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10005750</obo:OAE_0004334>
