        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000200"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>a hair AE that has an outcome of alopecia and occurs after a medical intervention. </obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>VAE, MW</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10001760</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:comment>alopecia means the absence of hair or loss of hair. It is not usually in reference to primary genetic hairlessness but may be due to dietary, stress, secondary to immune condition.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>alopecia AE</rdfs:label>
