        <obo:IAO_0000115>a movement disorder AE that has an outcome of eyes gaze upward</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;eyes gaze upward&apos; was mentioned in 1,249 VAERS reports (1.0%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>eyes gaze upward AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000418 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000418">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000570"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>a nervous system AE that shows a damage to or disease affecting the nerves.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Neuropathy is often classified according to the types or location of nerves that are affected. Neuropathy can also be classified according to the disease causing it. (For example, neuropathy from the effects of diabetes is called diabetic neuropathy. Ref: http://www.emedicinehealth.com/neuropathy/article_em.htm#types_of_neuropathy.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH, RR</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.emedicinehealth.com/neuropathy/article_em.htm</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.emedicinehealth.com/neuropathy/article_em.htm#types_of_neuropathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/147963.php</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.neuropathy.org/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>神经病变</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <rdfs:label>neuropathy AE</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>HPO: HP_0007141</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>SIDER: C0442874</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000419 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000419">
