        <obo:IAO_0000115>a skin adverse event that has an outcome of skin nodule</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;skin nodule&apos; was mentioned in 1,134 VAERS reports (0.9%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>skin nodule AE</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>HPO: HP_0200036</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>SIDER: C0037287</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


