        <obo:OAE_0004334>10043458</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:comment>Thirst is the craving for liquids, resulting in the basic instinct of humans or animals to drink. It is an essential mechanism involved in fluid balance.</rdfs:comment>
