        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS), &apos;abnormal stools&apos; was mentioned in 111 VAERS reports (&lt;0.1%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>abnormal stool AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


