        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS), &apos;bone pain&apos; was mentioned in 109 VAERS reports (&lt;0.1%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>YH, MW</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10006002</obo:OAE_0004334>
