        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;encephalitis&apos; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 480 VAERS reports (0.4%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <rdfs:label>brain inflammation AE</rdfs:label>
