        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;hepatitis&apos; was mentioned in 387 VAERS reports (0.3%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
