        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS), &apos;sinusitis&apos;; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 298 VAERS reports (0.2%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
