        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">an abnormal defecation AE that has an outcome of constipation, which is incomplete, infrequent or difficult evacuation of fecal matter</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS), &apos;constipation&apos;; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 242 VAERS reports (0.2%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>infrequent bowel movements AE</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10010774</obo:OAE_0004334>
