        <obo:IAO_0000115>an aspartate aminotransferase level abnormal AE that has an outcome of an increased amount of AST, an enzyme normally present in body tissues especially of the heart and liver</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>DJ, SS, YH, EB</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://medical-dictionary.thefreedictionary.com/aspartate+aminotransferase</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10003481</obo:OAE_0004334>
