        <obo:IAO_0000115>joint range of motion decreased AE is a mobility decreased AE that results in limited or decreased range of joint motion</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>SS, YH, MW</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048706</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>joint range of motion decreased AE</rdfs:label>
