        <obo:IAO_0000115>a skin AE that shows a result of skin ulcer, i.e., a sore on the skin or a mucous membrane, accompanied by the disintegration of tissue. Ulcers can result in complete loss of the epidermis and often portions of the dermis and even subcutaneous fat.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>SS, YH, MW</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>skin ulcer AE</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulcer_%28dermatology%29</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10040943</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10040947</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>skin ulceration AE</rdfs:label>
