        <obo:IAO_0000115>a hemorrhage AE that has an outcome of vaginal hemorrhage</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>MedDRA: 10046910 is for &quot;vaginal haemorrhage&quot;; MedDRA: 10046912  is for &quot;vaginal hemorrhage&quot;</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>SS, YH, MW</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>vaginal haemorrhage AE</obo:IAO_0000118>
