        <obo:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.nlm.nih.gov/medlineplus/ency/article/000750.htm</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10056673</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:comment>Neuropathy can affect nerves that provide feeling (sensory neuropathy) or cause movement (motor neuropathy). It can also affect both, in which case it is called a sensorimotor neuropathy.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>peripheral sensorimotor neuropathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


