        <obo:IAO_0000115>a hemorrhage AE that has an outcome of bleeding from anastomosis site. Anastomosis: pathological formation of an opening between two normally distinct spaces or organs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Yongqun He, Izabela Birsanescu</obo:IAO_0000117>
