        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000537"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Cholestatic liver injury AE is a liver damage AE that shows buildup of bile acids in hepatocytes, then causes hepatocellular injury.</obo:IAO_0000115>
