        <obo:IAO_0000115>Neutrophilopenia AE is a neutrophil count decreased AE that shows the number of neutrophil is decreased.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>JX, LW, YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>中性白细胞减少</obo:OAE_0001849>
