        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000628"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Central venous pressure increased AE is a mesaurement of the pressure of the blood within the superior and inferior vena cava and large veins of the body. Increased pressure can be the result of cardiac failure and congestion of circulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>SJ, YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
