</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10054938</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:comment>Brain disorders may affect the main areas of your brain that control how you move, think, and behave. Some tumors can constrict the blood vessels in your brain.</rdfs:comment>
