        <obo:IAO_0000115>a gamma-glutamyltransferase level increased AE that is greater than 5.0 - 20.0 times the upper limit of normal</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>MW, YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>Grade 3 gamma-glutamyltransferase level increased AE</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>CTCAE: E12164</rdfs:seeAlso>
