        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0003312"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the invasion of an organism&apos;s groin tissues by disease-causing agents, their multiplication, and the reaction of host tissues to the infectious agents and the toxins they produce.</obo:IAO_0000115>
