        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000364"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is any disorder of the nervous system. Structural, biochemical or electrical abnormalities in the brain, spinal cord or other nerves can result in a range of symptoms.</obo:IAO_0000115>
