        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜炎球菌脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014597</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis meningococcal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004902 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004902">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000731"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is recognised as a central factor in the development of many neurological disorders, but much less is known about the role of the blood-brain barrier in psychiatric disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28781208/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>血脑屏障缺陷</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10057361</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>blood brain barrier defect AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004903 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004903">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002393"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the effect of a intracranial growing mass that results in secondary pathological effects by pushing on or displacing surrounding tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Mass_effect_(medicine)</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>颅内肿块</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10077667</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>intracranial mass AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004904 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004904">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002393"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which may refer to an abnormal growth that usually appears on a baby&apos;s neck or head.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cystic_hygroma</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑水囊瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052370</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral hygroma AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004905 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004905">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which means any allergic disorder or disease of the brain, especially chronic degenerative conditions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Encephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>过敏性脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014627</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalopathy allergic AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004906 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004906">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001791"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which presents with symptoms of nausea, vomiting, and dizziness and thus mimics benign conditions such as viral gastroenteritis or labyrinthitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25439292/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>栓塞性小脑梗死</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10084072</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>embolic cerebellar infarction AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004907 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004907">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000660"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which refers a protein encoded by the gene NODAL and responsible for left-right asymmetry.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Nodal</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>结性节律</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10029470</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>nodal rhythm AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004908 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004908">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000081"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which refers to head was lacking in comfort.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Comfort</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>头部不适</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10019194</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>head discomfort AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004909 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004909">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which which occurs a few weeks after recovery from influenza is thought to be an autoimmune process associated with demyelination and vasculopathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/9316161/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>流感性脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10058094</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis influenzal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004910 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004910">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000214"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the thickening, hardening, and loss of elasticity of the walls of arteries.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Arteriosclerosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部动脉硬化</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10065559</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral arterio sclerosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004911 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004911">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001749"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE whichis vasculitis (inflammation of the blood vessel wall) involving the brain and occasionally the spinal cord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_vasculitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部动脉炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008087</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral arteritis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004912 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004912">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000236"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an abnormal narrowing in a cerebral artery blood vessel or other tubular organ or structure such as foramina and canals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Stenosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部动脉狭窄</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10063648</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral artery stenosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004913 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004913">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000542"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a neurological sign consisting of lack of voluntary coordination of muscle movements that can include gait abnormality, speech changes, and abnormalities in eye movements.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Ataxia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑性共济失调</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10050389</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral ataxia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004914 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004914">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a common feature of many of the diseases that affect the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_atrophy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部萎缩</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008096</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral atrophy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004915 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004915">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the accumulation of calcium salts in a cerebral body tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Calcification</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部钙化</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10066296</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral calcification AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004916 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004916">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000821"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is defined as a general or specific failure of the circulation, either cardiac.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Circulatory_collapse</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部循环衰竭</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008097</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral circulatory failure AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004917 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004917">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which may refer to heart failure resulting in congestion in one or more organs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Congestion</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部堵塞</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10076929</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral congestion AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004918 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004918">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002393"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a cerebral closed sac, having a distinct envelope and division compared with the nearby tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cyst</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部囊肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061445</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral cyst AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004919 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004919">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000066"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a medical condition caused by dissolved gases emerging from solution as bubbles inside the cerebral body tissues during decompression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Decompression_sickness</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>大脑减压</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052940</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral decompression AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004920 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004920">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which may refer to relating to the brain disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部疾病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10054938</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral disorder AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004921 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004921">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of dysgenesis in adults that alters the size and shape of their cells that lead to abnormal development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Dysgenesis_(embryology)</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑发育不全</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10056467</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral dysgenesis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004922 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004922">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000650"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a localized bleeding outside of cerebral blood vessels, due to either disease or trauma including injury or surgery and may involve blood continuing to seep from broken capillaries.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Hematoma</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部血肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10053942</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral hematoma AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004923 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004923">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000801"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a sudden bleeding into the tissues of the brain, into its ventricles, or into both.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Intracerebral_hemorrhage</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑出血</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008111</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral hemorrhage AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004924 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004924">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000801"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a sudden bleeding into the tissues of the brain occured on foetal, into its ventricles, or into both.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Intracerebral_hemorrhage</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑出血胎儿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10050157</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral hemorrhage foetal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004925 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004925">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000617"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of hypoxia (reduced supply of oxygen), specifically involving the brain; when the brain is completely deprived of oxygen, it is called cerebral anoxia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_hypoxia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑灌注不足</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10065384</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral hypoperfusion AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004926 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004926">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002354"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is mainly found in patients with Alzheimer&apos;s disease and lacunar infarction, and becomes one of the main reasons of death and disability in diabetic patients.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28822176/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑微血管病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10067466</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral microangiopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004927 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004927">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000801"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is abnormal differences seen in magnetic resonance imaging of the brain of Alzheimer&apos;s disease patients, associated with amyloid-modifying therapies, particularly human monoclonal antibodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Amyloid-related_imaging_abnormalities</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑微出血</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10067277</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral microhemorrhage AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004928 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004928">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000731"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which refers to a group of pathological processes with various aetiologies that affect the small arteries, arterioles, venules, and capillaries of the brain with ischaemic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20610345/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑小血管缺血性疾病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10070878</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral small vessel ischemic disease AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004929 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004929">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004573"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the final product of the blood coagulation step in hemostasis on cerebral.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Thrombus</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑血栓形成</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008132</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral thrombosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004930 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004930">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a parasitic disease caused by Toxoplasma gondii, an apicomplexan.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Toxoplasmosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑弓形体病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10057854</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral toxoplasmosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004931 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004931">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004534"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the presence of a blood clot in the dural venous sinuses (which drain blood from the brain), the cerebral veins, or both.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_venous_sinus_thrombosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑静脉窦血栓形成</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10083037</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral venous sinus thrombosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004932 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004932">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which can refer to various forms of transient loss of consciousness caused by  cerebral ventricle such as syncope, or loss of postural muscle tone without loss of consciousness .</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Collapse</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑心室塌陷</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10073706</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral ventricle collapse AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004933 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004933">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000783"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is defined as dilation of the fetal cerebral ventricles and is a relatively common finding on prenatal ultrasound.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29705191/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑室扩张</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048824</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebral ventricle dilatation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004934 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004934">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000364"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare congenital disorder characterized by the reduction or absence of functional peroxisomes in the cells of an individual.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Zellweger_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑肝肾综合征</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10053684</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebrohepatorenal syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004935 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004935">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000534"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a medical condition in which poor blood flow to the brain causes cell death.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Stroke</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑血管中风</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008190</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebrovascular accident AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004936 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004936">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an abnormal cerebrovascular connection between arteries and veins, bypassing the capillary system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Arteriovenous_malformation</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑血管动静脉畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10056371</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebrovascular arteriovenous malformation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004937 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004937">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000493"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which includes a variety of medical conditions that affect the blood vessels of the brain and the cerebral circulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebrovascular_disease</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑血管疾病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008196</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebrovascular disorder AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004938 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004938">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000493"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which includes a variety of medical conditions that affect the blood vessels of the brain and the cerebral circulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebrovascular_disease</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑血管机能不全</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10058842</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebrovascular insufficiency AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004939 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004939">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000800"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a common CNS manifestation of mitochondrial disorders (MIDs) and has been reported in specific and non-specific MIDs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007%2Fs11011-018-0238-y</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑萎缩</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008027</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar atrophy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004940 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004940">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001744"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the lodging of an embolus, a blockage-causing piece of material, inside a cerebellar blood vessel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Embolism</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑栓塞</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10067167</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar embolism AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004941 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004941">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000427"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which accounts for 5-10% of all intracerebral haemorrhages and leads to severe, long-lasting functional deficits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28318366/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑出血</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008030</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar hemorrhage AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004942 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004942">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is characterized by reduced cerebellar volume, even though cerebellar shape is (near) normal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebellar_hypoplasia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑发育不全</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008033</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar hypoplasia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004943 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004943">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an important cause of stroke that often presents with common and non-specific symptoms such as dizziness, nausea and vomiting, unsteady gait, and headache.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18848314/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑梗死</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008034</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar infarction AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004944 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004944">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001790"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which may present in a completely different way from common stroke syndromes in the anterior cerebral circulation and can initially mimic benign vestibular neuritis and may later deteriorate into a life-threatening neurologic state.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29891068/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑卒中</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10079062</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar stroke AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004945 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004945">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000052"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a type of abnormal and excessive growth of cerebellar tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Neoplasm</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061750</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar tumor AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004946 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004946">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000469"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an abscess caused by inflammation and collection of infected material, coming from local (ear infection, dental abscess, infection of paranasal sinuses, infection of the mastoid air cells of the temporal bone, epidural abscess) or remote (lung, heart, kidney etc.) infectious sources, within the brain tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Brain_abscess</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑脓肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10006105</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain abscess AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004947 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004947">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a bruise of the brain tissue and can be associated with multiple microhemorrhages, small blood vessel leaks into brain tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_contusion</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑挫伤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052346</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain contusion AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004948 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004948">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000617"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of hypoxia (reduced supply of oxygen), specifically involving the brain; when the brain is completely deprived of oxygen, it is called cerebral anoxia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_hypoxia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>大脑缺氧</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10006127</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain hypoxia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004949 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004949">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an abnormality of the structure of brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Birth_defect#congenital_malformation</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>大脑畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048409</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain malformation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004950 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004950">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an important feature that can be measured using various imaging modalities including X-ray, ultrasound, computed tomography, and magnetic resonance imaging.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29849536/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>大脑中线移位</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10069551</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain midline shift AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004951 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004951">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which occurs when abnormal cells form within the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Brain_tumor</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061019</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain neoplasm AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004952 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004952">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000079"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a mass of brain cells (tumor) that lacks the ability to either invade neighboring tissue or metastasize (spread throughout the body).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Benign_tumor</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>良性大脑肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10006129</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain neoplasm benign AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004953 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004953">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001205"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is commonly called brain cancer and they invade and destroy the surrounding tissue, may form metastases and, if untreated or unresponsive to treatment, will generally prove fatal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Neoplasm</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>恶性大脑肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10006131</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain neoplasm malignant AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004954 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004954">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000761"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is excess accumulation of fluid (edema) in the intracellular or extracellular spaces of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_edema</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑部水肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048962</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain edema AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004955 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004955">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an auditory evoked potential extracted from ongoing electrical activity in the brain and recorded via electrodes placed on the scalp.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Auditory_brainstem_response</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑干听觉诱发反应</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10049507</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain stem auditory evoked response AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004956 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004956">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001790"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which falls under the broader category of stroke syndromes, or specific symptoms caused by vascular injury to an area of brain (for example, the lacunar syndromes).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Brainstem_stroke_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑干中风</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10068644</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain stem stroke AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004957 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004957">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000364"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is  most commonly due to occlusion of the posterior circulation or mass effect from intrinsic space-occupying lesions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31283463/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑干综合症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10063292</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>brain stem syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004958 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004958">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000427"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a hemorrhage of blood between the skull and the periosteum of any age human, including a newborn baby secondary to rupture of blood vessels crossing the periosteum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cephalohematoma</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>头颅血肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008014</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cephal hematoma AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004959 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004959">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a major abnormality in the shape of head compared to the normal shape of that part.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Deformity</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>头畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061199</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>head deformity AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004960 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004960">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is related to medical factors and early neurobehavior, but it may not be a good predictor of outcome when used in isolation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26709421/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>头滞后</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10057870</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>head lag AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004961 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004961">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is tremor of the head and is of cerebellar origin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Tremor#Titubation</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>摇头</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10064950</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>head titubation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004962 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004962">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a condition in which circumference of the human head is abnormally large.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Macrocephaly</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>大头畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10050183</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>macrocephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004963 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004963">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a medical condition involving a smaller-than-normal head and may be present at birth or it may develop in the first few years of life.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Microcephaly</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小脑症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10068320</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>microencephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004964 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004964">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a medical condition involving a smaller-than-normal head and may be present at birth or it may develop in the first few years of life.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Microcephaly</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>小头畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027534</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>microcephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004965 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004965">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a condition characterized by an asymmetrical distortion (flattening of one side) of the skull.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Plagiocephaly</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>斜头畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048586</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>plagiocephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004966 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004966">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an asymmetric deformation of skull due to various reasons; first birth, assisted labor, multiple pregnancy, prematurity, congenital muscular torticollis and position of head.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32380806/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>位置斜头畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10068711</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>positional plagiocephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004967 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004967">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a condition that affects the development of the human brain by multiple small gyri (microgyri) creating excessive folding of the brain leading to an abnormally thick cortex.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Polymicrogyria</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>多小脑回</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10073489</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>polymicrogyria AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004968 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004968">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000542"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a progressive, degenerative, genetic disease with multiple types, each of which could be considered a neurological condition in its own right.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脊髓小脑性共济失调</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10057660</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>spino cerebellar ataxia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004969 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004969">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000800"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE whichis a diverse group of rare, slowly progressive, neurological diseases, often inherited but of incompletely understood pathophysiology, which affect the cerebellum and its related pathways.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/14521474/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脊髓小脑疾病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061551</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>spino cerebellar disorder AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004970 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004970">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002362"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare childhood neurological syndrome and is characterized by the sudden or gradual development of aphasia (the inability to understand or express language) and an abnormal electroencephalogram (EEG).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Landau%E2%80%93Kleffner_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>获得性癫痫性失语</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052075</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>acquired epileptic aphasia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004971 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004971">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002362"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an inability to comprehend or formulate language because of damage to specific brain regions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Aphasia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>失语症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10002948</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>aphasia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004972 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004972">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001790"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a type of severe heat illness that results in a body temperature greater than 40.0 °C (104.0 °F).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Heat_stroke</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>热射病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10019345</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>heat stroke AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004973 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004973">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001790"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the most common type of ischaemic stroke, resulting from the occlusion of small penetrating arteries that provide blood to the brain&apos;s deep structures.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Lacunar_stroke</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>腔隙性中风</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10076994</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>lacunar stroke AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004974 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004974">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is sudden damage to the brain caused by a blow or jolt and it has one of the highest mortality and disability rates in the world.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7607269/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>颅脑损伤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10070976</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>craniocerebral injury AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004975 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004975">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a condition in which one or more of the fibrous sutures in a young infant&apos;s skull prematurely fuses by turning into bone (ossification), thereby changing the growth pattern of the skull.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Craniosynostosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>颅缝早闭</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10049889</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>craniosynostosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004976 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004976">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000956"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a break in one or more of the eight bones that form the cranial portion of the skull, usually occurring as a result of blunt force trauma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Skull_fracture</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>颅骨骨折</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061365</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>skull fracture AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004977 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004977">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is bicoronal craniosynostosis is characterized by a wide, short skull.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Carpenter_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>颅骨畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10062348</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>skull malformation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004978 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004978">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is encephalitis due to herpes simplex virus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Herpesviral_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>单纯疱疹性脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10019953</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>herpes simplex encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004979 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004979">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is meningitis associated with herpes simplex virus (HSV).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Herpesviral_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>单纯疱疹性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10019956</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>herpes simplex meningitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004980 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004980">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a medical condition that simultaneously resembles both meningitis, which is an infection or inflammation of the meninges, and encephalitis, which is an infection or inflammation of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningoencephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>单纯疱疹性脑膜脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10074247</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>herpes simplex meningo encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004981 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004981">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is characterized by recurrent clinical seizures and prominent interictal epileptiform discharges seen during the early infantile period.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26271793/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>癫痫性脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10077380</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>epileptic encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004982 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004982">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a type of meningitis due to a herprs zoster infection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Viral_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>带状疱疹脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10074259</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>herpes zoster meningitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004983 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004983">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a medical condition that simultaneously resembles both meningitis, which is an infection or inflammation of the meninges, and encephalitis, which is an infection or inflammation of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningoencephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>带状疱疹脑膜脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10074248</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>herpes zoster meningo encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004984 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004984">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002467"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is tissue death (necrosis) due to inadequate blood supply to the affected area.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Infarction</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑梗死</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061216</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>infarction AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004985 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004985">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a particular abnormal change in appearance of white matter near the lateral ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Leukoaraiosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑白质疏松症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10051765</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>leukoaraiosis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004986 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004986">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a group of usually inherited disorders characterized by degeneration of the white matter in the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Leukodystrophy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑白质营养不良</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10024381</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>leukodystrophy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004987 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004987">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of encephalitis, a disease characterized by inflammation of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Limbic_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>边缘脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10078012</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>limbic encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004988 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004988">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000052"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the three membranes that envelop the brain and spinal cord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meninges</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061282</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningeal neoplasm AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004989 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004989">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is typically a slow-growing tumor that forms from the meninges, the membranous layers surrounding the brain and spinal cord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningioma</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027191</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningioma AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004990 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004990">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a set of symptoms similar to those of meningitis but not caused by meningitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningism</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>假性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027192</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningism AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004991 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004991">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is usually lethal unless appropriate antibiotics that cross the blood-brain barrier are given.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30273239/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>细菌性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027202</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis bacterial AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004992 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004992">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a potentially fatal fungal infection of mainly the lungs, presenting as a pneumonia, and brain, where it appears as a meningitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cryptococcosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>隐球菌脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027209</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis cryptococcal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004993 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004993">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of bacterial meningitis caused by the Haemophilus influenzae bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Haemophilus_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>嗜血杆菌脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027241</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis haemophilus AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004994 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004994">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an acute inflammation of the protective membranes covering the brain and spinal cord caused by herps.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜炎疱疹</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027242</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis herpes AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004995 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004995">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of bacterial meningitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningococcal_disease#Meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜炎球菌性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027249</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis meningococcal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004996 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004996">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a viral disease caused by the mumps virus and complications include deafness and a wide range of inflammatory conditions, of which inflammation of the meninges.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Mumps</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜炎腮腺炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027250</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis mumps AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004997 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004997">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a serious medical condition in infants that is rapidly fatal if untreated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Neonatal_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>新生儿脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10058780</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis neonatal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004998 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004998">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which continues to be associated with high rates of mortality and long-term neurological sequelae and the most common route of infection starts by nasopharyngeal colonization by Streptococcus pneumoniae, which must avoid mucosal entrapment and evade the host immune system after local activation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21734248/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>肺炎球菌脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027253</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis pneumococcal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004999 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004999">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a symptomatic meningitis  infection caused by bacteria of the Salmonella type .</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Salmonellosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>沙门氏菌脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027254</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis salmonella AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005000 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005000">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a specific type of bacterial meningitis caused by the Mycobacterium tuberculosis infection of the meninges—the system of membranes which envelop the central nervous system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Tuberculous_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>结核性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027259</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis tuberculous AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005001 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005001">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a type of meningitis due to a viral infection and it results in inflammation of the meninges.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Viral_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>病毒性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027260</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningitis viral AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005002 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005002">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000636"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a birth defect in which there is incomplete closing of the spine and the membranes around the spinal cord during early development in pregnancy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Spina_bifida</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑脊膜突出</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027266</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningocele AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005003 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005003">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000488"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a Gram-negative bacterium that can cause meningitis and other forms of meningococcal disease such as meningococcemia, a life-threatening sepsis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Neisseria_meningitidis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜炎球菌感染</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027274</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningococcal infection AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005004 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005004">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000618"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which describes infections caused by the bacterium Neisseria meningitidis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningococcal_disease</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜炎球菌败血症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027280</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningococcal sepsis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005005 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005005">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is meningitis associated with herpes simplex virus (HSV).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Herpesviral_meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膜脑炎疱疹</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027285</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningo encephalitis herpetic AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005006 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005006">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000636"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a birth defect in which there is incomplete closing of the spine and the membranes around the spinal cord during early development in pregnancy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Spina_bifida</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑脊膜脊髓膨出</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10027287</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>meningomyelocele AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005007 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005007">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a lysosomal storage disease which is commonly listed in the family of leukodystrophies as well as among the sphingolipidoses as it affects the metabolism of sphingolipids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Metachromatic_leukodystrophy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>异染性脑白质营养不良</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10067609</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>metachromatic leukodystrophy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005008 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005008">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which refers to any syndrome or disorder of mental function whose cause is alleged to be known as organic (physiologic) rather than purely of the mind.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Organic_brain_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>器质性脑综合征</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10031077</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>organic brain syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005009 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005009">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a fibrosing and inflammatory process, which involves the dura mater.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28413094/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>硬脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10053658</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>pachymeningitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005010 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005010">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of encephalomyopathy that is associated with a mitochondrial disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Mitochondrial_encephalomyopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>线粒体脑肌病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10058799</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>mitochondrial encephalomyopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005011 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005011">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which represents a syndrome of temporary or permanent disturbance of brain functions that occurs in different diseases and varies in clinical presentation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28084256/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>代谢脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10062190</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>metabolic encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005012 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005012">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000478"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a hyperacute and frequently fatal form of ADEM.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Acute_disseminated_encephalomyelitis#Acute_hemorrhagic_leukoencephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>白质脑脊髓炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048999</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>leuko encephalo myelitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005013 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005013">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of hypoxia (reduced supply of oxygen), specifically involving the brain; when the brain is completely deprived of oxygen, it is called cerebral anoxia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_hypoxia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>缺氧性脑病变</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10021147</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>hypoxic encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005014 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005014">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a neural tube defect characterized by sac-like protrusions of the brain and the membranes that cover it through openings in the skull.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Encephalocele</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑膨出</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014617</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalo cele AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005015 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005015">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a localized softening of the substance of the brain, due to bleeding or inflammation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_softening</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑软化</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10051818</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalo malacia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005016 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005016">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000478"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is inflammation of the brain and spinal cord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Encephalomyelitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑脊髓炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014619</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalo myelitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005017 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005017">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is defined by signs and symptoms of abnormal neurological function in the first few days of life in an infant born at term.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Neonatal_encephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑病新生儿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014633</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalopathy neonatal AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005018 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005018">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a type of encephalitis that can result from a number of autoimmune diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Autoimmune_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>自身免疫性脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10072378</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis autoimmune AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005019 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005019">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which defines as an illness characterized by myoclonus, ataxia, nystagmus, oculomotor palsies, and bulbar palsy in various combinations, with or without neuroimaging.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22956971/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑干脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048997</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis brain stem AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005020 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005020">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is discovered in Kern County, California and causes encephalitis in humans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/California_encephalitis_orthobunyavirus</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>加州脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014584</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis california AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005021 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005021">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an important opportunistic infection in HIV-infected patients but is rarely recognized in other groups.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/8815757/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑炎巨细胞病毒</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014586</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis cytomegalovirus AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005022 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005022">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is defined by the presence of an inflammatory process of the brain in association with clinical evidence of neurologic dysfunction caused by enteroviral.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25175874/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>肠病毒性脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10063946</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis enteroviral AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005023 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005023">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is encephalitis due to herpes simplex virus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Herpesviral_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑炎疱疹</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014590</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis herpes AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005024 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005024">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an infection of the brain caused by the Japanese encephalitis virus (JEV).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Japanese_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>日本乙型脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014596</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis japanese b AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005025 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005025">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an atypical form of encephalitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Encephalitis_lethargica</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>埃科诺莫氏病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052369</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis lethargica AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005026 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005026">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a viral disease caused by the mumps virus and may occur encephalitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Mumps</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑炎流行性腮腺炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014598</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis mumps AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005027 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005027">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is inflammation of the brain parenchyma, called encephalitis, by a virus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Viral_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>病毒性脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10014612</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>encephalitis viral AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005028 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005028">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a brain injury in which scattered lesions occur over a widespread area in white matter tracts as well as grey matter.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Diffuse_axonal_injury</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑弥漫性轴索损伤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10066213</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>diffuse axonal injury AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005029 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005029">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000364"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare endocrine condition featuring a low blood sodium concentration and dehydration in response to injury (trauma) or the presence of tumors in or surrounding the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_salt-wasting_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑性盐耗综合征</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10078827</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>csws syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005030 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005030">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a head injury that temporarily affects brain functioning.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Concussion</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑震荡</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10010254</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>concussion AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005031 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005031">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002467"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the pathologic process that results in an area of necrotic tissue in the brain (cerebral infarct) with embolic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_infarction</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>栓塞性脑梗死</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10060839</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>embolic cerebral infarction AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005032 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005032">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a neurological condition characterized by encephalopathy, thyroid autoimmunity, and good clinical response to corticosteroids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Hashimoto%27s_encephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>桥本脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10069432</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>hashimoto&apos;s encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005033 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005033">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a cephalic disorder in which the prosencephalon (the forebrain of the embryo) fails to develop into two hemispheres.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Holoprosencephaly</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>前脑无裂畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10056304</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>holoprosencephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005034 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005034">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the common collective name for human betaherpesvirus 6A (HHV-6A) and human betaherpesvirus 6B (HHV-6B) and can be associated with encephalitis in the case of immunocompromised patients.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Human_herpesvirus_6</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>人疱疹病毒脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10081897</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>human herpesvirus 6 encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005035 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005035">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000478"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a syndrome (a set of signs and symptoms) with encephalomyelitis that is the consequence of cancer in the body, specifically due to the production of chemical signaling molecules (such as hormones or cytokines) by tumor cells or by an immune response against the tumor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Paraneoplastic_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑脊髓脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10069587</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>paraneoplastic encephalomyelitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005036 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005036">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which can result from neonatal encephalopathy and perinatal arterial ischaemic stroke, usually at term, but also in preterm infants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25686754/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>围产期脑损伤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10056392</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>perinatal brain damage AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005037 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005037">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002467"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of white-matter brain injury, characterized by the necrosis (more often coagulation) of white matter near the lateral ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Periventricular_leukomalacia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>室周的脑栓塞</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052594</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>periventricular leukomalacia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005038 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005038">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a set of symptoms that may continue for weeks, months, or a year or more after a concussion – a mild form of traumatic brain injury (TBI).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Post-concussion_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑震荡综合征</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10057230</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>post concussion syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005039 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005039">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a neurologic disorder caused by exposure to neurotoxic organic solvents such as toluene, following exposure to heavy metals such as manganese, as a side effect of melarsoprol treatment for African trypanosomiasis, adverse effects to prescription drugs, or exposure to extreme concentrations of any natural toxin such as cyanotoxins found in shellfish or freshwater cyanobacteria crusts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Toxic_encephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>中毒性脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10044221</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>toxic encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005040 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005040">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare condition that is characterized by progressive damage (-pathy) to white matter (-leuko-) in the brain (-encephalo-), particularly myelin, due to causes such as exposure to substance use, environmental toxins, or chemotherapeutic drugs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Toxic_leukoencephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>中毒性白质脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10075528</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>toxic leukoencephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005041 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005041">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a hyperacute and frequently fatal form of acute disseminated encephalomyelitis(ADEM).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Acute_disseminated_encephalomyelitis#Acute_hemorrhagic_leukoencephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>急性出血性白细胞脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10058994</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>acute haemorrhagic leukoencephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005042 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005042">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an acute inflammation of the protective membranes covering the brain and spinal cord caused by adenoviral.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Meningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>腺病毒性脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10080442</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>adenoviral meningitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005043 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005043">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is rare but well recognised entity usually manifesting 1-4 weeks after anoxic exposure and characteristic subcortical white matter demyelination with necrosis of globus pallidus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/7644404/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>缺氧脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10050750</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>anoxic encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005044 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005044">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a structural defect in the cerebellum, characterized by a downward displacement of one or both cerebellar tonsils through the foramen magnum (the opening at the base of the skull).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Chiari_malformation</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>阿－基氏脑畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>1003101</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>arnold-chiari malformation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005045 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005045">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a motor disorder caused by damage to the brain (specifically the posterior parietal cortex or corpus callosum) which causes difficulty with motor planning to perform tasks or movements.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Apraxia</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>失用症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10003062</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>apraxia AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005046 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005046">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which represents a complex category of disease with diverse immunologic associations, clinical manifestations, and therapeutic outcomes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21590620/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>自身免疫性脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10075691</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>autoimmune encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005047 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005047">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare inflammatory disorder of the central nervous system,It may also affect the peripheral nervous system, and has features in common with both Miller Fisher syndrome and Guillain Barré syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Bickerstaff_brainstem_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>比克斯塔夫脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10076985</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>bickerstaff&apos;s encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005048 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005048">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002402"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare and fatal autosomal recessive degenerative disorder that causes progressive damage to nerve cells and loss of white matter in the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Canavan_disease</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>海绵状脑白质营养不良症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10067608</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>canavan disease AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005049 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005049">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rodent-borne viral infectious disease that presents as aseptic meningitis, encephalitis or meningoencephalitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Lymphocytic_choriomeningitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>淋巴细胞性脉络丛脑膜炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10008761</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>chorio meningitis lymphocytic AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005050 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005050">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an extremely rare cephalic disorder involving encephalomalacia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Porencephaly</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脑穿通畸形</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10036172</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>porencephaly AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005051 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005051">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare condition in which parts of the brain are affected by swelling, usually as a result of an underlying cause.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Posterior_reversible_encephalopathy_syndrome</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>后部可逆性脑病综合征</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10071066</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>posterior reversible encephalopathy syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005052 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005052">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is commonly associated with significant morbidity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=postresuscitation+encephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>复苏后脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10068191</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>postresuscitation encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005053 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005053">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare and often fatal viral disease characterized by progressive damage (-pathy) or inflammation of the white matter (leuko-) of the brain (-encephalo-) at multiple locations (multifocal).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Progressive_multifocal_leukoencephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>进行性多灶性白质脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10036807</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>progressive multifocal leukoencephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005054 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005054">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare inflammatory neurological disease, characterized by frequent and severe seizures, loss of motor skills and speech, hemiparesis (weakness on one side of the body), encephalitis (inflammation of the brain), and dementia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Rasmussen%27s_encephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>拉斯姆森脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10071141</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>rasmussen encephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005055 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005055">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a common complication in septic patients and clinical presentation may range from mild confusion and disorientation to convulsions and deep coma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30280261/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>败血性脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10069141</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>septic encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005056 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005056">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000079"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare benign disease that can cause myelopathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26585731/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>脊髓脑膜囊肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10067375</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>spinal meningeal cyst AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005057 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005057">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002468"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is either caused by trauma including that arising from medical interventions or spontaneously sometimes in those with predisposing conditions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cerebrospinal_fluid_leak</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>自发性脑脊液漏综合征</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10073081</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>spontaneous cerebrospinal fluid leak syndrome AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005058 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005058">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000558"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a rare form of chronic, progressive brain inflammation caused by slow infection with certain defective strains of hypermutated measles virus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Subacute_sclerosing_panencephalitis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>亚急性硬化性全脑炎</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10042297</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>subacute sclerosing panencephalitis AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005059 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005059">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002467"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which can present with a variety of sensory deficits that can be difficult to diagnose clinically because of their seemingly disconnected manifestations.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23269103/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>丘脑梗塞</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10064961</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>thalamic infarction AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005060 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005060">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001893"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an injury to the brain caused by an external force.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Traumatic_brain_injury</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>创伤性脑损伤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10060690</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>traumatic brain injury AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005061 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005061">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a disease linked to the X chromosome and is a result of fatty acid buildup caused by a defect in the very long chain of fatty acids transporter in peroxisomes, which then causes damage to the myelin sheath of the nerves, resulting in seizures and hyperactivity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Adrenoleukodystrophy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>肾上腺脑白质营养不良</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10051260</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>adrenoleukodystrophy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005062 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005062">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000494"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which means any disorder or disease of the brain caused by AIDs, especially chronic degenerative conditions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Encephalopathy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>艾滋病脑病</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10049072</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>aids encephalopathy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005063 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005063">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001551"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a communication disorder resulting in incoherent talkativeness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Logorrhea</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>多语症，速语症</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10024796</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>logorrhoea AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005064 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005064">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000052"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a closed sac on the pituitary, having a distinct envelope and division compared with the nearby tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cyst</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>垂体囊肿</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10051687</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>pituitary cyst AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005065 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005065">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the increase in the volume of pituitary tissue due to the enlargement of its component cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Hypertrophy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>垂体增大</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10048675</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>pituitary enlargement AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005066 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005066">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000052"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is tumors that occur in the pituitary gland.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Pituitary_adenoma</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>垂体肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10035104</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>pituitary tumor AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005067 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005067">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000079"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a pituitary mass of cells (tumor) that lacks the ability to either invade neighboring tissue or metastasize (spread throughout the body).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Benign_tumor</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>良性垂体肿瘤</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061538</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>pituitary tumor benign AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005068 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005068">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is characterized by the absence of a subjacent cerebral lesion and neurological or intellectual deficit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11785036/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>特发性局灶性癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10076552</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>idiopathic partial epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005069 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005069">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000579"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is seizures which affect initially only one hemisphere of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Focal_seizure</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>部分癫痫发作</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10061334</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>partial seizures AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005070 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005070">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a group of non-communicable neurological disorders characterized by recurrent epileptic seizures.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Epilepsy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10015037</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005071 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005071">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a single seizure lasting more than 5 minutes or two or more seizures within a five-minute period without the person returning to normal between them.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Status_epilepticus</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>癫痫持续状态</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10041962</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>status epilepticus AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005072 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005072">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000579"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is common, particularly in the setting of medically refractory epilepsy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25695133/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>癫痫发作群</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10071350</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>seizure cluster AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005073 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005073">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is primarily a disorder of childhood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/414604/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>癫痫小发作癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10034759</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>petit mal epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005074 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005074">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a neurological disorder that is characterized by brief, recurring seizures that arise in the frontal lobes of the brain, often while the patient is sleeping.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Frontal_lobe_epilepsy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>额叶癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10049424</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>frontal lobe epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005075 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005075">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which should be recognized as a discrete epileptic syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21093732/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>非典型良性部分癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10056699</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>atypical benign partial epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005076 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005076">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000579"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a period of symptoms due to abnormally excessive or synchronous neuronal activity in the brain caused by hyperglycaemic .</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Seizure</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>高血糖癫痫发作</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10071394</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>hyperglycaemic seizure AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005077 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005077">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000579"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is divided into simple and dyscognitive, with the latter resulting in the alteration of consciousness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28362654/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>局灶性认知障碍癫痫发作</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10079424</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>focal dyscognitive seizures AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005078 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005078">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the most common epilepsy syndrome in childhood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Rolandic_epilepsy</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>良性中央癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10070530</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>benign rolandic epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005079 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005079">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is subdivided into syndromes based on clinical and EEG features.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17223580/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>特发性全身性癫痫</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10071081</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>idiopathic generalised epilepsy AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005080 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005080">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000579"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a type of seizure that consists of partial or complete loss of muscle tone that is caused by temporary alterations in brain function.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Atonic_seizure</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>无源性癫痫发作</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10003628</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>atonic seizures AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005081 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005081">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002552"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a period of symptoms due to abnormally excessive or synchronous neuronal activity in the brain and is psychogenic .</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Seizure</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>心因性癫痫发作</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10058895</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>psychogenic seizure AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005082 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005082">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000479"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is condition that affects one side of the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Hemiplegic_migraine</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>偏瘫型偏头痛</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10019476</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>hemiplegic migraine AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005083 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005083">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000479"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a complication of migraine (with or without aura), representing an attack that lasts for more than 72 h.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30198804/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>偏头痛状态</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10052945</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>status migrainosus AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005084 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005084">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000377"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a neurological disorder characterized by recurrent severe headaches on one side of the head, typically around the eye.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Cluster_headache</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>丛集性头痛</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10059133</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>cluster headache AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005085 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005085">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the decreased (hypo) secretion of one or more of the eight hormones normally produced by the pituitary gland at the base of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Hypopituitarism</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>垂体机能减退</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10021067</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>hypopituitarism AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005086 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005086">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002464"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a particular abnormal change in appearance of white matter near the lateral ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Leukoaraiosis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>白质病变</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10072731</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>white matter lesion AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005087 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005087">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is basal ganglia  tissue death (necrosis) due to inadequate blood supply to the affected area.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Infarction</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>基底节梗塞</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10069020</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>basal ganglia infarction AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005088 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005088">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000479"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a primary headache disorder characterized by recurrent headaches that are moderate to severe.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Migraine</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>基底性偏头痛</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10050258</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>basilar migraine AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005089 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005089">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an anatomical feature of the infant human skull comprising soft membranous gaps (sutures) between the cranial bones that make up the calvaria of a fetus or an infant and it is depressed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Fontanelle</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>囟门凹陷</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10053214</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>fontanelle depressed AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005090 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005090">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which case as a patient with a bulging fontanelle, normal neuroimaging and cerebrospinal fluid analysis, and absence of a depressed level of consciousness, focal neurologic findings, or identified cause.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16291356/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>囟门膨大</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10016945</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>fontanelle bulging AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005091 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005091">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002466"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which includes achondroplasia, hypothyroidism, Down syndrome, increased intracranial pressure, and rickets.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12825844/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>囟门延迟关闭</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10054034</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>delayed fontanelle closure AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005092 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005092">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000448"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which has itself since been replaced by other terms</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Intellectual_disability#Terminology</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>严重智力低下</obo:OAE_0001849>
        <obo:OAE_0004334>10036791</obo:OAE_0004334>
        <rdfs:label>profound mental retardation AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005093 -->


    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0005093">
