        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000550"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a decrease in the total amount of red blood cells (RBCs) or hemoglobin in the blood or a lowered ability of the blood to carry oxygen caused by haemorrhagic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
