        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000197"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is tissue death (necrosis) due to inadequate blood with haemorrhagic supply to the affected area .</obo:IAO_0000115>
