        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0004246"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which appears as a complex cystic mass arising from an ovary, with a reticular pattern of internal echoes representing internal fibrin strands.</obo:IAO_0000115>
