        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000647"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an inflammatory condition of the lung primarily affecting the small air sacs known as alveoli  with haemorrhagic .</obo:IAO_0000115>
