        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the presence of gallstones in the common bile duct (CBD) (thus choledocho- + lithiasis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
