        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000647"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an inflammatory condition  caused by escherichia of the lung primarily affecting the small air sacs known as alveoli.</obo:IAO_0000115>
