        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000439"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a sound made at the back of the throat by tightly constricting the laryngopharyngeal tissues and vibrating the palatoglossal arch and the vocal folds while exhaling through the nose.</obo:IAO_0000115>
