        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000511"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is inflammation with noninfective of salivary glands, usually the major ones, the most common being the parotid gland, followed by submandibular and sublingual glands.</obo:IAO_0000115>
