        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0002037"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a thin, cone-shaped membrane that separates the external ear from the middle ear and the process of membrane hyperaemia .</obo:IAO_0000115>
