        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001392"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is part of the complex biological response of body tissues to harmful stimuli such as paranasal sinus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
