        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000557"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is part of the complex biological response of tonsillar tissues to harmful stimuli.</obo:IAO_0000115>
