        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000211"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a discontinuity or break in a tonsillar  membrane that impedes normal function of the affected tonsillar .</obo:IAO_0000115>
