        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000374"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is often underestimated and neglected because of various myths, beliefs, and difficulties in its evaluation and treatment.</obo:IAO_0000115>
