        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an aids related unfavorable result of a disease, health condition, or treatment .</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Complication_(medicine)</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>艾滋病相关并发症</obo:OAE_0001849>
