        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a life-threatening condition that arises when the body&apos;s response to infection causes injury to its own tissues and organs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Sepsis</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:OAE_0001849>导管脓毒症</obo:OAE_0001849>
