        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000097"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of viral shedding following a viral infection caused by a statistically insignificant number[citation needed] of administrations of attenuated (or &quot;live virus&quot;) vaccines, which is a specific vaccine technology that uses an attenuated form of a live virus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
