        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000622"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which in major trauma is infrequent, with complex problems of diagnosis and treatment.</obo:IAO_0000115>
