        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000651"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is the invasion of an organism&apos;s body tissues by disease-causing agents, their multiplication, and the reaction of host tissues to the infectious agents and the toxins they produce such as genital infection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>QY, JX, HY</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.volupedia.org/wiki/Infection</obo:IAO_0000119>
