        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000651"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which can arise from a variety of conditions, crimes, trauma, medical treatments, physical diseases, mental illness and infections.</obo:IAO_0000115>
