        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000086"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is inflammation of the skin, typically characterized by itchiness, redness and a rash and is infected.</obo:IAO_0000115>
