        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000063"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is a form of Still&apos;s disease, a rare systemic autoinflammatory disease characterized by the classic triad of fevers, joint pain, and a distinctive salmon-colored bumpy rash.</obo:IAO_0000115>
