        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000063"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is an AE which is an extremely rare long-term systemic disorder that involves the formation of granulomas and inflammation of blood vessels (vasculitis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
